cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite this repository. Simulations
  should also cite the force field and the structure source.
title: "adaptamem: question-conditioned membrane-protein MD"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
authors:
  - family-names: Snow
    given-names: Eric
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/snowe36/adaptamem"
abstract: >-
  Chooses physical resolution, box, and sampling for a membrane-protein
  question at minimum cost. ns/day comparisons are only valid inside
  the same physics class.
keywords:
  - molecular dynamics
  - membrane protein
  - OpenMM
  - CHARMM36
  - adaptive sampling
